  "description": "Every time the indescribably handsome Team Leader Ju tears into him, Assistant Manager Lim gets a little too…excited. It’s embarrassing, it’s distracting, and it’s getting harder and harder to hide. Then, one late night at the office, Ju catches him in a very obvious state, and the rough, heated encounter Lim has only ever fantasized about finally comes to fruition - only for Ju to start avoiding him completely after it's done. Was it a one-time mistake, or is Ju running from feelings too big to admit?\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/211032637), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000082032)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Handsome_Price), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/toxic_price) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://www.lezhinus.com/en/comic/handsomeprice)\n\n##### Note: All official translations are uncensored.",
